  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APSM II Regional support to the peace process 2021-2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">APSM II Regionalt st&#xf6;d till fredsprocessen 2021-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet har f&#xf6;r avsikt att etablera h&#xe5;llbara kanaler f&#xf6;r track 1-2 kommunikation mellan Afghanistan och Pakistan som integrerar perspektiv fr&#xe5;n regionen i den afghanska fredsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to establish sustainable channels of Track 2 and 1.5 communication across Afghanistan and Pakistan that integrate the perspectives of a diverse group of actors in the Afghan peace process.</narrative>
  </description>
